  "description": "<p dir=\"ltr\">This supplementary material is provided for the reviewers of the paper \"katIA: Hybrid Source Code Change Impact Analysis\".</p><p dir=\"ltr\">It consists of the following:</p><ol><li><b>final_dataset.csv</b> which is the final version of our labeled dataset</li><li><b>Prompts/baseline.j2</b> which is the prompt used in the single prompt variant of katIA</li><li><b>Prompts/agents.yaml</b> which contains the definitions of the agents used in the multi-agent variant of katIA</li><li><b>Prompts/tasks.yaml</b> which contains the definitions of the tasks used in the multi-agent variant of katIA</li><li><b>StaticCodeAnalysis-1.0-SNAPSHOT-jar-with-dependencies</b> which is the .jar of our static code analysis tool used in the first phase of katIA for Static Impact Set Construction</li></ol><p dir=\"ltr\">If you use this content, please cite: <a href=\"https://doi.org/10.48550/arXiv.2611.10958\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\">Hybrid Source Code Change Impact Analysis</a></p>",
